      "_id": "af29660b47264a8c",
      "name": "Vicissitude — 3 Advanced — Blood of Acid",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Permanently converts your vitae into organic acid. Any Blood Trait that contacts something other than you inflicts two levels of aggravated damage; anyone drinking your vitae takes four levels of aggravated damage per Blood Trait. When a penetrating attack injures you in close combat, make a Simple Test; on a win, you lose one Blood Trait that sprays toward your attacker, who must win a Static Physical Challenge (difficulty five) or take one level of aggravated damage. Objects piercing you corrode away within minutes, and stakes dissolve within five turns.</p>",
        "source": "Sabbat Guide, Disciplines",
        "discipline": "Vicissitude",
